@repo = grahamkatana/daily-digest
@date = 20260901

### List all digests (returns download_url for each — click through from here)
GET https://api.github.com/repos/{{repo}}/contents/digests
Accept: application/vnd.github+json

### Latest digest
GET https://raw.githubusercontent.com/{{repo}}/main/digests/latest.md

### A specific digest — edit @date above, then send this one
GET https://raw.githubusercontent.com/{{repo}}/main/digests/digest_{{date}}.md
